---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Blog" current="">
  <section class="page">
    <div class="pagehead"><h2>The Buzz Blog</h2><span>Two voices, one Austin</span></div>
    <p>Local Buzz ATX explains the news. The blog is where our columnists add their own take, one on tech and business, one on entertainment and culture.</p>
    <div class="colcards">
      <a class="colcard" href="/blog/caleb">
        <img class="art-av art-av-lg" src="/authors/caleb.jpg" alt="Illustration of Caleb" width="56" height="56" />
        <div><div class="lplabel">Caleb's Corner</div><b>Caleb</b><p>Tech, business, AI and Austin growth. What it means for your work and your wallet, with no hype.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="colcard" href="/blog/tori">
        <img class="art-av art-av-lg" src="/authors/tori.jpg" alt="Illustration of Tori" width="56" height="56" />
        <div><div class="lplabel">Quick Tea</div><b>Tori</b><p>Entertainment, music, culture and Austin buzz. A quick, honest take on what everyone is talking about.</p></div>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="aitag">Caleb and Tori are pen names, and their pictures are illustrations. <a href="/about">About Local Buzz ATX</a></p>
  </section>
</Layout>
